' purpose: exact package references from independently expected index bytes
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/package-index.mjs
' covers: tooling/native-ingress/package-index.test.mjs
' context: _spec/_plans/ml-runtime-redesign.md section 33 owns provenance qualification.
@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
left to right direction
title Package references — exact identities, no trust promotion
actor "Expected index bytes/digest\npackage/version/arch/source requests" as CALLER <<host>>
component "selectPackageReferences\nprivate snapshot + SHA-256" as INDEX <<app>>
component "Case-insensitive Deb822 fields\ncomplete folded-value validation" as FIELDS <<app>>
component "Frozen exact package references\nfilename / length / SHA256" as REFS <<app>>
component "PackageIndexError\nfixed failure; no partial refs" as ERROR <<error>>
CALLER ARROW_MAIN INDEX : authenticate complete expected bytes before parsing
INDEX ARROW_MAIN FIELDS : bounded paragraphs; reject duplicates
FIELDS ARROW_MAIN REFS : exactly one stanza per requested identity
REFS ARROW_MAIN CALLER : caller request order; paths remain inert metadata
INDEX ARROW_ERROR ERROR : bad input/reference or digest mismatch
FIELDS ARROW_ERROR ERROR : missing/ambiguous/source mismatch or unsafe file
ERROR ARROW_ERROR CALLER : no alternate version/architecture/path fallback
note bottom of INDEX
Input<=16MiB; paragraphs<=65536
Paragraph<=128KiB; selected value<=1024 bytes
Targets<=8; package<=8MiB; JSON<=64KiB
No reader, fetch, process or resolver callback
end note
note bottom of REFS
Package/version/architecture match exactly
Source name/version match independently expected
Signature/provenance/source/Native flags:false
No path or reference authorizes acquisition
end note
@enduml
